asset:        lbpcascade_frontalface.xml
title:        LBP frontal face cascade (face finding for Auto Focus and Studio Light)
author:       OpenCV contributors (OpenCV team)
source:       https://github.com/opencv/opencv/blob/4.x/data/lbpcascades/lbpcascade_frontalface.xml (commit f4fa6371cb7e62db8271ba393e99ef5abcd6a2f3)
